    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Requirements</strong> You are unarmored.</p><hr /><p>You channel the pure luminescence of the Silver Flame through your body, cloaking your hands and feet in silvery sacred flame. While in this stance, the only Strikes you can make are argent fist unarmed attacks. These deal 1d6 bludgeoning damage; are in the brawling group; and have the agile, finesse, holy, nonlethal, silver, and unarmed traits.</p><p>When you Strike a fiend or undead creature with an argent fist attack, the attack deals an additional 1d4 spirit damage and counts as cold iron in addition to silver for overcoming resistances.</p>"
